              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खळबळ — khaḷbaḷ — \"a sensation; a stir\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "त्या बातमीने शहरात खळबळ उडाली. tyā bātmīne śahrāt khaḷbaḷ uḍālī. That news caused a sensation in the city."
