              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खळबळ (khaḷbaḷ) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi khaḷbaḷṇe, 'to agitate', under Sanskrit khalati, 'shakes' (CDIAL 3837); the noun names the stir."
