            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निवेदकाने आजच्या ठळक बातम्या वाचल्या. nivedakāne ājacyā ṭhaḷak bātamyā vācalyā. The newsreader read out today's main headlines."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It keeps one form: ठळक (ṭhaḷak) अक्षरं, bold letters; ठळक (ṭhaḷak) बातम्या, the headlines."
            }
          ]
        },
